WEBVTT


00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.080
I am in the fifth poorest country in the world.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.160
here most people live

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.440
with less than a dollar a day.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.040
and here the kitchen.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.160
but what I see on the street is not just poverty,

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.240
is talent,

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.640
it's music,

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.960
something no money

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:32.640
can buy.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.040
Thanks man,

00:00:37.041 --> 00:00:37.801
Valeu bro!

00:00:37.802 --> 00:00:38.761
I like you bro

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.520
but still

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.320
lack of opportunity

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.760
and that's why I decided to do a different challenge.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.120
my idea is

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.120
produce the biggest talent show in this city

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:52.880
and award the winner

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.120
with twenty thousand meticais.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.600
welcome to mozambique!

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:01.520
and that challenge starts now.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.160
talent show there,

00:01:03.161 --> 00:01:04.801
Or twenty thousand meticais!

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:06.840
who wants to do the talent show there?

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:07.720
Talent show!

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:08.760
who knows how to dance,

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:09.216
sing, 

00:01:09.216 --> 00:01:12.040
agree with prize of twenty thousand meticais?

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:13.520
can sing?

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.960
can't sing,

00:01:15.961 --> 00:01:16.961
dance, rap?

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:08.720
Thanks,

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:09.920
We are there!

00:02:09.921 --> 00:02:12.161
but what's hardest for me is choosing the place,

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.040
otherwise I'm doing

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:14.960
promote a talent show and I have nothing.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:16.360
but it will work.

